{'symbol': 'CAT', 'date': '2022-11-03 09:00:00', 'title': 'CATERPILLAR RAISES RECORD $13.8 MILLION IN UNITED WAY CAMPAIGN', 'text': 'FUNDS WILL HELP IMPROVE THE LIVES OF INDIVIDUALS IN COMMUNITIES ACROSS THE UNITED STATES, MEXICO, CANADA AND PANAMA IRVING, TEXAS , NOV. 3, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- CATERPILLAR INC. (NYSE: CAT) EMPLOYEES AND RETIREES TOGETHER WITH THE CATERPILLAR FOUNDATION, THE PHILANTHROPIC ORGANIZATION OF CATERPILLAR, HAVE PLEDGED MORE THAN\xa0$13.8 MILLION TO THE UNITED WAY CHAPTERS ACROSS\xa0THE UNITED STATES, MEXICO, CANADA AND PANAMA\xa0AS PART OF ITS 2022-2023 CAMPAIGN.\xa0THIS RECORD AMOUNT IS A $1 MILLION INCREASE FROM 2021.'}